      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="libgnome-desktop/gnome-qr-gtk/gnome-qr-widget.c"
           line="31">The `GnomeQrWidget` widget displays a rendered QR Code.

## CSS nodes

`GnomeQrWidget` has a single CSS node with the name `gnome-qr-code`.
It can be themed using the `color` and `background-color` properties.

## Accessibility

`GnomeQrWidget` uses the `GTK_ACCESSIBLE_ROLE_IMG` role.</doc>
